{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51476","headline":"五湖冬日 · 李郢","name":"五湖冬日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚人家住五湖东，斜掩柴门水石中。\n猎猎夜山明远烧，骚骚寒苇动疎风。\n园林向腊停霜果，葭菼和烟宿暝鸿。\n范蠡扁舟不知处，一将前事话渔翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}